First of all, hp3_lptr is not a valid name.  The correct syntax (per RFC822) is
{{letter|digit}{0{letter|digit|hyphen}...n{letter|digit|hyphen}}}.

In other words, hp3-lptr is correct, hp3_lptr is not.  If your DNS contains the
underscore, have your networks people fix the problem as soon as possible.
The Compaq/Digital is a little more intollerant of errors than HP.

