I do not understand the reference to UFS.  UFS does not have an addvol
feature.

Also, once you do an addvol, ONLY AdvFS knows there is more than one
volume.  There would be no such thing as "addvol directories".  Just
more disk space in the domain.

You should provide output from  'showfdmn' to verify that the volume
has been added and is currently being seen by AdvFS.

                                        Bob Harris


