> 
> Software: I have Tru64 5.1 non-commercial including a whole bunch of CDs
> with additional software.
> Hardware: A 10GB IDE disk, and I will be installing from a SB IDE CD-ROM

My understanding is that Tru64 cannot boot from an IDE disk.  Assuming 
that is correct, you might be able to install it, but you won't be able 
to boot. :-)

