The command line from automount is ok?

i.e.:

automount [-m] -f /etc/auto.master
------------------^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
It is very important that you have write the full 
pathanme from the auto.master file in the comand line.

My automount files and maps are:

/etc/auto.master
#
# mount-point           mapname                 mount-options
#
/home   /etc/auto.home  -rw

#
#
/etc/auto.home
        *       -rw     host:/home/&

"host" - the host where the "home" directory is exportet.

