: ipcs -a ist the answer.

Well, ipcs -a will only show the PID of the last process, which attached
to the region. There may be more than one process attached (there may
also be none), and these may attach and detach in any order they choose.
Moreover, the pids are, eventually, reused - so that the pids returned
by ipcs -a are not particularly meaningful.

/Serge.P

