Hi,

If you experience problems with program "lnusertemp" which misses its
libz.so file right after login, an intermediate fix is to do:

     # ln -s /usr/local/kde21/lib/libz.so /usr/local/lib/libz.so

The reason is that lnusertemp does not have the proper RPATH compiled
in. It only has /usr/local/lib set as its RPATH and thus only looks
there for the shared libraries.

I'll be fixed in the next release.

Have a nice weekend everybody // Tom
